            },
            {
              "rank": "3",
              "name": "LA",
              "value": "little",
              "note": "high tax + rent",
              "color": "#17120f",
              "bar": 0.4
            },
            {
              "rank": "4",
              "name": "NYC / SF",
              "value": "least",
              "note": "the squeeze",
              "color": "#c0392b",
              "bar": 0.25
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s2"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The cost of living quietly decides how far a paycheck stretches.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-col",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · cost of living"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s3"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The gap between best and worst can be tens of thousands a year, on the identical salary.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "map",
          "big": "$30K+",
          "label": "gap, same salary",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s4"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Only your disposable income tells you how you'll actually live.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-disposable",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · disposable income"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s5"
    },
    {
      "narration": "That's why chasing the biggest offer in the priciest city can leave you feeling broke.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "Big offer, broke life",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "x"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "narration": "It all comes down to purchasing power, what your money can buy locally.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-ppp",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · purchasing power"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The offer letter is just a headline; what matters is the quiet number left after rent and tax.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "After rent & tax",
          "props": [
